  "content": "<!doctype lake><meta name=\"doc-version\" content=\"1\" /><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"fixed\" /><p data-lake-id=\"u5363421c\" id=\"u5363421c\"><span data-lake-id=\"uc75a04a5\" id=\"uc75a04a5\">推导式指的是轻量级循环</span><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u9d5da7f8\" id=\"u9d5da7f8\">创建数据</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"u19a6890a\" id=\"u19a6890a\">的方式，</span><span data-lake-id=\"u3949c649\" id=\"u3949c649\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(34, 34, 34)\">对列表或可迭代对象中的每个元素应用某种操作，用生成的结果创建新的列表；或用满足特定条件的元素创建子序列。</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"u251e6c4e\" id=\"u251e6c4e\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"ufe84efba\" id=\"ufe84efba\">推导式包括：</span></strong></p><ul list=\"u593d0c02\"><li fid=\"uf6477183\" data-lake-id=\"ucde30dcc\" id=\"ucde30dcc\"><span data-lake-id=\"u684eab17\" id=\"u684eab17\">列表推导式</span></li><li fid=\"uf6477183\" data-lake-id=\"u04ec011a\" id=\"u04ec011a\"><span data-lake-id=\"u7751a562\" id=\"u7751a562\">元组推导式</span></li><li fid=\"uf6477183\" data-lake-id=\"u456bf640\" id=\"u456bf640\"><span data-lake-id=\"ufe01ced7\" id=\"ufe01ced7\">集合推导式</span></li><li fid=\"uf6477183\" data-lake-id=\"udff2e37f\" id=\"udff2e37f\"><span data-lake-id=\"ub7f6055f\" id=\"ub7f6055f\">字典推导式</span></li></ul><h2 data-lake-id=\"l5dk5\" id=\"l5dk5\" data-lake-index-type=\"2\"><span data-lake-id=\"u00c6fb0d\" id=\"u00c6fb0d\">列表推导式</span></h2><p data-lake-id=\"u030ca759\" id=\"u030ca759\"><span data-lake-id=\"ud7171bd9\" id=\"ud7171bd9\">列表推导式的格式：</span><code data-lake-id=\"uae46776a\" id=\"uae46776a\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"uc12a7663\" id=\"uc12a7663\">[计算公式 for循环 if判断]</span></strong></code></p><p data-lake-id=\"udf7e4ece\" id=\"udf7e4ece\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"ucca2587c\" id=\"ucca2587c\">​</span></strong><br></p><p data-lake-id=\"u97d0df51\" id=\"u97d0df51\"><span data-lake-id=\"u21b389d9\" id=\"u21b389d9\">通过列表推导式快速创建</span><code data-lake-id=\"u02bc2ecb\" id=\"u02bc2ecb\"><span data-lake-id=\"u3e0d7b5d\" id=\"u3e0d7b5d\">[1, 11)</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"uef0e2dc5\" id=\"uef0e2dc5\">所有</span><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u15e37003\" id=\"u15e37003\">数字</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"u6c26f13f\" id=\"u6c26f13f\">的列表</span></p><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22python%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22lst%20%3D%20%5Bele%20for%20ele%20in%20range(1%2C%2011)%5D%5Cn%23%20%5B1%2C%202%2C%203%2C%204%2C%205%2C%206%2C%207%2C%208%2C%209%2C%2010%5D%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Atrue%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22default%22%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22Ibind%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card><p data-lake-id=\"u7a358590\" id=\"u7a358590\"><br></p><p data-lake-id=\"ub58a51de\" id=\"ub58a51de\"><span data-lake-id=\"uce690865\" id=\"uce690865\">通过列表推导式快速创建</span><code data-lake-id=\"u328f5ad2\" id=\"u328f5ad2\"><span data-lake-id=\"u791a57b0\" id=\"u791a57b0\">[1, 11)</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"u6dbbab4f\" id=\"u6dbbab4f\">所有</span><strong><span data-lake-id=\"ua4e9bc37\" id=\"ua4e9bc37\">偶数</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"u02dc31b4\" id=\"u02dc31b4\">的列表</span></p><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22python%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22lst%20%3D%20%5Bele%20for%20ele%20in%20range(1%2C%2011)%20if%20ele%20%25%202%20%3D%3D%200%5D%5Cn%23%20%5B2%2C%204%2C%206%2C%208%2C%2010%5D%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Atrue%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22default%22%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22R20qd%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card><p data-lake-id=\"ua7ea4e02\" id=\"ua7ea4e02\"><br></p><p data-lake-id=\"u77a74b80\" id=\"u77a74b80\"><span data-lake-id=\"u27d237ad\" id=\"u27d237ad\">通过列表推导式快速创建</span><code data-lake-id=\"ua8332108\" id=\"ua8332108\"><span data-lake-id=\"u6d20bdc2\" id=\"u6d20bdc2\">[1, 11)</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"uaeed0434\" id=\"uaeed0434\">所有</span><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u137a03cb\" id=\"u137a03cb\">偶数的平方</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"ue2fd9076\" id=\"ue2fd9076\">的列表</span></p><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22python%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22lst%20%3D%20%5Bele%20**%202%20for%20ele%20in%20range(1%2C%2011)%20if%20ele%20%25%202%20%3D%3D%200%5D%5Cn%23%20%5B4%2C%2016%2C%2036%2C%2064%2C%20100%5D%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Atrue%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22default%22%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22mSmRD%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card><h2 data-lake-id=\"uB7ix\" id=\"uB7ix\" data-lake-index-type=\"2\"><span data-lake-id=\"u92afc685\" id=\"u92afc685\">元组推导式</span></h2><p data-lake-id=\"u20b2d143\" id=\"u20b2d143\"><span data-lake-id=\"u0cf807c5\" id=\"u0cf807c5\">元组推导式的格式:</span><code data-lake-id=\"u8b3a4f29\" id=\"u8b3a4f29\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"ue855ca75\" id=\"ue855ca75\">(计算公式 for循环 if判断)</span></strong></code><span data-lake-id=\"u0452cc3e\" id=\"u0452cc3e\">，其他与列表推导式一致</span></p><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22python%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22tp%20%20%3Dtuple(ele%20for%20ele%20in%20range(1%2C%2011))%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Atrue%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22default%22%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22customStyle%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22id%22%3A%22Qm9a3%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card><h2 data-lake-id=\"fisbJ\" id=\"fisbJ\" data-lake-index-type=\"2\"><span data-lake-id=\"uf4a09d9e\" id=\"uf4a09d9e\">集合推导式</span></h2><p data-lake-id=\"u903f05df\" id=\"u903f05df\"><span data-lake-id=\"u84280310\" id=\"u84280310\">集合推导式的格式:</span><code data-lake-id=\"uba26a2a3\" id=\"uba26a2a3\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u7328d46e\" id=\"u7328d46e\">{计算公式 for循环 if判断}</span></strong></code><span data-lake-id=\"uf548a6a0\" id=\"uf548a6a0\">，其他与列表推导式一致</span></p><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22python%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22s%20%3D%20%7Bele%20for%20ele%20in%20range(1%2C%2011)%7D%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Atrue%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22default%22%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22seCaq%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card><h2 data-lake-id=\"BqO5w\" id=\"BqO5w\" data-lake-index-type=\"2\"><span data-lake-id=\"u935de8ce\" id=\"u935de8ce\">字典推导式</span></h2><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22python%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22d%20%3D%20%7Bkey%3Avalue%20for%20key%2C%20value%20in%20zip(range(1%2C10)%2Crange(21%2C30))%7D%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Atrue%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22default%22%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22__widthMode%22%3A%22normal%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22fLeOg%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%2C%22widthMode%22%3A%22normal%22%7D\"></card><p data-lake-id=\"u68b7ef95\" id=\"u68b7ef95\"><code data-lake-id=\"u2932ee29\" id=\"u2932ee29\"><span data-lake-id=\"u01c4c269\" id=\"u01c4c269\">zip(..., ...)</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"u46d4fd40\" id=\"u46d4fd40\">将</span><code data-lake-id=\"u554ffd5e\" id=\"u554ffd5e\"><span data-lake-id=\"u6ff1c3a0\" id=\"u6ff1c3a0\">range(1,10)</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"u2ab8473f\" id=\"u2ab8473f\">和</span><code data-lake-id=\"uff4c32c8\" id=\"uff4c32c8\"><span data-lake-id=\"u43340c00\" id=\"u43340c00\">range(21,30)</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"u818f1e4d\" id=\"u818f1e4d\">里的每个元素一一组合成元组</span></p><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22python%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22(1%2C%2021)%5Cn(2%2C%2022)%5Cn(3%2C%2023)%5Cn...%5Cn(8%2C%2028)%5Cn(9%2C%2029)%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Atrue%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22default%22%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22g6kWt%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card><p data-lake-id=\"u3b2bd549\" id=\"u3b2bd549\"><span data-lake-id=\"u72502398\" id=\"u72502398\">再把这些元组打包成一个可迭代对象。</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"u2321ecbe\" id=\"u2321ecbe\"><span data-lake-id=\"ud5ba8271\" id=\"ud5ba8271\">​</span><br></p><h2 data-lake-id=\"vVpQS\" id=\"vVpQS\" data-lake-index-type=\"2\"><span data-lake-id=\"u4a0555ef\" id=\"u4a0555ef\">推导式练习</span></h2><h3 data-lake-id=\"cOzSk\" id=\"cOzSk\" data-lake-index-type=\"2\"><span data-lake-id=\"ua994bdd8\" id